flowchart TD
  D["server/discover<br/>advertises the Apps extension"] --> TL["tools/list: the tool names<br/>its UI resource (ui:// URI)"]
  TL --> CALL["tools/call returns<br/>content + structured data"]
  CALL --> H["Host fetches the UI resource<br/>(resources/read, cached as code)"]
  H --> V["Renders it in a sandboxed frame<br/>and binds the data"]
  V -->|"user acts"| B["App asks the host<br/>to call tools"]
  B --> CALL
